OL,3,GNEWSAStrictly a 'dream come true' after
OL,4,Astroke recovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV dog trainer Graeme Hall says it is a
OL,7,F"dream come true" to be on Strictly
OL,8,FCome Dancing, after a stroke made him
OL,9,Fthink he would never dance again.
OL,11,FThe Brackley-based Dogs Behaving (Very)
OL,12,FBadly star will appear on the BBC One
OL,13,Fshow when it launches in September,
OL,14,Fdespite giving up dancing after falling
OL,15,Fill in 2019.
OL,17,FKnown as the Dogfather on the Channel 5
OL,18,Ftelevision series, Hall has previously
OL,19,Fdanced in local competitions, including
OL,20,FStrictly Northampton.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
