OL,3,GNEWSAStrictly a 'dream come true' after
OL,4,Astroke recovery
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There are not a lot of people in the
OL,7,Fworld that have had the chance to do
OL,8,Fthis. So I'm just going to love every
OL,9,Fminute, enjoy it for what it is and
OL,10,Fhope it keeps going as long as
OL,11,Fpossible," he said.
